sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant CLI as BioAnalyzer CLI
    participant ENV as .env / settings
    participant DC as Docker Compose
    participant API as FastAPI backend
    participant ORCH as Agent Orchestrator
    participant RET as Retrieval Services
    participant RAG as RAG + Vector Store
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant OUT as Output Formatter

    U->>CLI: BioAnalyzer start
    CLI->>ENV: Load environment and config
    CLI->>DC: Start required services
    DC->>API: Launch backend container
    CLI->>API: GET /health
    API-->>CLI: Healthy

    U->>CLI: BioAnalyzer analyze --file "curatable papers.xls" --format csv --output results.csv
    CLI->>CLI: Parse PMIDs from file
    CLI->>API: Request analysis for each PMID

    loop For each PMID
        API->>ORCH: Start analysis workflow
        ORCH->>RET: Fetch paper metadata and text
        RET-->>ORCH: Return source content
        ORCH->>RAG: Build/query context chunks
        RAG->>LLM: Prompt for structured extraction
        LLM-->>RAG: Model response
        RAG-->>ORCH: Ranked evidence + extracted values
        ORCH->>ORCH: Validate 6 BugSigDB fields
        ORCH-->>API: Final per-paper result
        API-->>CLI: Result payload
    end

    CLI->>OUT: Convert results to CSV
    OUT-->>CLI: results.csv content
    CLI-->>U: Save file and print completion summary
